Dynamic Re-order Point and Safety Stock Calculation (Non-Seasonal Model with Different Service Levels): Calculating and presenting replenishment metrics for the non-seasonal model at different service levels (90% and 97.5%) with a 7-day lead time.
Dynamic Re-order Point and Safety Stock Calculation (Seasonal Model with Different Service Levels): Calculating and presenting replenishment metrics for the seasonal model at different service levels (90%, 95%, and 99%) with a 7-day lead time.
